cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ion in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Ion: a persistent general agent runtime with durable memory and bounded execution"
abstract: >-
  Ion is an advanced general agent from MatrixMCL: one persistent identity with
  encrypted, actor-scoped memory, provider-neutral model execution with explicit
  fallback, and policy-, approval-, idempotency-, and audit-bound access to
  tools, projects, browsers, and specialist agents. Authority lives in a Go
  runtime; thin web and terminal operators render a generated control-plane
  protocol and never invent subsystem state.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MatrixMCL"
    website: "https://matrixmcl.com"
url: "https://ion.matrixmcl.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/paxlabs-inc/ion-agent"
license: MIT
keywords:
